---
import "../styles/global.css";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Menu from "../components/menu.astro";
---

<Layout>
    <div class="flex min-h-screen text-slate-900">
        <Menu />
        <main class="min-w-0 flex-1 bg-slate-50 p-8 pb-12" id="reporte-taller">
            <header class="mb-7 flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-slate-500">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 ring-4 ring-emerald-100"></span> Panel de control <span class="text-slate-400">/</span> Reporte por taller</div>
                <a class="font-medium text-blue-700 no-underline" href="/"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left mr-2"></i> Volver al inicio</a>
            </header>

            <section class="relative flex min-h-48 justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-10 py-9 shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/5" aria-labelledby="report-title">
                <div><p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-blue-700">CAPACIDAD Y SEGUIMIENTO</p><h1 class="mb-2 text-3xl font-medium text-slate-900" id="report-title">Reporte por taller</h1><p class="m-0 text-xs text-slate-600">Consulta la carga de trabajo, capacidad y responsables de cada taller.</p></div>
                <div class="z-10 mr-20 grid size-20 -rotate-6 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-3xl text-blue-700 shadow-md" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-screwdriver-wrench"></i></div>
            </section>

            <section class="relative mt-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/5">
                <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div><p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-blue-700">DIRECTORIO</p><h2 class="text-lg font-medium">Perfiles de talleres</h2><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Selecciona un taller para revisar y actualizar su avance.</p></div>
                    <button class="cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-blue-700 bg-blue-700 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md shadow-blue-700/15" id="new-workshop-button" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus mr-2"></i> Crear perfil de taller</button>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3" id="workshop-grid"><div class="col-span-full rounded-lg border border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 p-8 text-center text-slate-600"><i class="fa-solid fa-screwdriver-wrench mb-3 text-3xl text-blue-700"></i><p class="mb-1 font-medium text-slate-900">Aún no hay perfiles de talleres.</p><span class="text-xs">Crea un perfil para asignar órdenes y consultar su carga de trabajo.</span></div></div>
            </section>
        </main>
    </div>

    <dialog class="fixed left-1/2 top-1/2 m-0 max-h-screen w-full max-w-3xl -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-xl border-0 p-0 text-slate-900 shadow-2xl shadow-blue-950/35" id="workshop-dialog" aria-labelledby="workshop-dialog-title">
        <form class="max-h-screen overflow-y-auto p-7" id="workshop-form">
            <div class="mb-6 flex items-start justify-between"><div><p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-blue-700">DIRECTORIO DE TALLERES</p><h2 class="text-xl font-medium" id="workshop-dialog-title">Perfil de taller</h2></div><button class="close-dialog cursor-pointer border-0 bg-transparent text-lg text-slate-600" type="button" aria-label="Cerrar formulario"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button></div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">
                <label class="flex flex-col gap-2">Nombre del taller <input class="w-full rounded-md border border-blue-200 p-3 font-normal outline-blue-600" name="name" required placeholder="Ej. Confecciones Norte" /></label>
                <label class="flex flex-col gap-2">Responsable <input class="w-full rounded-md border border-blue-200 p-3 font-normal outline-blue-600" name="contact" required placeholder="Nombre del responsable" /></label>
                <label class="flex flex-col gap-2">Tipo de taller <span class="rounded-md border border-blue-200 bg-slate-50 p-3 font-normal">Externo</span><input name="type" type="hidden" value="Externo" /></label>
                <label class="flex flex-col gap-2">Especialidad <input class="w-full rounded-md border border-blue-200 p-3 font-normal outline-blue-600" name="specialty" required placeholder="Ej. Confección y acabados" /></label>
                <label class="flex flex-col gap-2">Teléfono <input class="w-full rounded-md border border-blue-200 p-3 font-normal outline-blue-600" name="phone" placeholder="Número de contacto" /></label>
                <label class="flex flex-col gap-2">Capacidad mensual <input class="w-full rounded-md border border-blue-200 p-3 font-normal outline-blue-600" name="capacity" type="number" min="1" required placeholder="Unidades" /></label>
                <label class="flex flex-col gap-2">Total de pago <input class="w-full rounded-md border border-blue-200 p-3 font-normal outline-blue-600" name="totalPayment" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" required placeholder="S/ 0.00" /></label>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-6 flex justify-end gap-3"><button class="close-dialog cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-blue-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600" type="button">Cancelar</button><button class="cursor-pointer rounded-lg border-0 bg-blue-700 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white" type="submit"><i class="fa-solid fa-check mr-2"></i> Guardar perfil</button></div>
        </form>
    </dialog>

    <dialog class="fixed left-1/2 top-1/2 m-0 max-h-screen w-full max-w-3xl -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-xl border-0 p-0 text-slate-900 shadow-2xl shadow-blue-950/35" id="workshop-detail-dialog" aria-labelledby="workshop-detail-title">
        <form class="max-h-screen overflow-y-auto p-7" id="workshop-detail-form">
            <div class="mb-6 flex items-start justify-between"><div><p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-blue-700">SEGUIMIENTO DEL AUDITOR</p><h2 class="text-xl font-medium" id="workshop-detail-title">Detalle del taller</h2></div><button class="close-dialog cursor-pointer border-0 bg-transparent text-lg text-slate-600" type="button" aria-label="Cerrar detalle"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button></div>
            <p class="mb-5 text-xs text-slate-500">Define manualmente qué porcentaje del procedimiento está terminado.</p>
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 p-5">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm font-bold text-slate-700"><span>Avance del procedimiento</span><output class="text-2xl text-blue-700" id="progress-output">0%</output></div>
                <input class="my-5 w-full cursor-pointer accent-blue-700" id="progress-range" name="progress" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="0" />
                <div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-slate-500"><span>Inicio</span><span>Completado</span></div>
                <div class="mt-5 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-blue-200 pt-4 text-sm text-slate-600"><span>Pago acumulado</span><output class="text-xl font-semibold text-emerald-700" id="payment-output">S/ 0.00</output></div>
            </div>
            <label class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">Observaciones del auditor <textarea class="w-full resize-y rounded-md border border-blue-200 p-3 font-normal outline-blue-600" id="progress-notes" name="notes" rows="3" placeholder="Añade una observación opcional"></textarea></label>
            <div class="mt-6 flex justify-end gap-3"><button class="close-dialog cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-blue-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600" type="button">Cancelar</button><button class="cursor-pointer rounded-lg border-0 bg-blue-700 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white" type="submit"><i class="fa-solid fa-check mr-2"></i> Guardar avance</button></div>
        </form>
    </dialog>
</Layout>

<style>
    dialog::backdrop { background: rgb(9 39 72 / 65%); backdrop-filter: blur(4px); }
</style>
